{"id":47344,"ord":56,"n_segments":152,"prev":47343,"next":47345,"doc":{"id":"61125","title":"61125_Teddy Bunn oral history interview","collection":"rutgers","inst":"Rutgers — Institute of Jazz Studies","interviewee":"Theodore Leroy Bunn","interviewer":"","date":"","year":"","source_url":"https://rucore.libraries.rutgers.edu/rutgers-lib/61125/","url":"https://semlab.io/linked-jazz-transcripts/?t=61125"},"chapter":"Leo Watson and the Panassie sessions","title":"Tommy Ladnier and the Panassie session personnel","category":"recording_session","summary":"Rosenberg introduces the 1938 Panassie session with Ladnier, Mezzrow, Pops Foster and Manzie Johnson; Bunn remembers Ladnier as a wonderful man and musician.","period":"1938","year_from":1938,"year_to":1938,"words":183,"start":[95,1],"end":[96,15],"url":"https://semlab.io/linked-jazz-transcripts/?t=61125#s47344","tags":{"places":[{"name":"New Orleans","focus":0,"type":"city"},{"name":"New York","focus":0,"type":"city"}],"venues":[],"bands":[]},"people":[{"name":"Tommy Ladnier","qid":"Q489563","n":4},{"name":"Milton Mezzrow","qid":"Q326297","n":2},{"name":"Manzie Johnson","qid":"Q1891968","n":2},{"name":"Pops Foster","qid":"Q2005676","n":2},{"name":"Chuck Rosenberg","qid":null,"n":1},{"name":"Hugues Panassié","qid":"Q647445","n":1}],"story":{"theme":42,"theme_name":"In the studio: making records, then and now","community":98,"community_name":"My first record date: sessions, personnel, discography","core":false},"blocks":[{"p":95,"b":1,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Okay. What I wanted to talk about today, if we can recollect the situation --"},{"p":95,"b":2,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah, Chuck."},{"p":95,"b":3,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"-- was the Panassie sessions."},{"p":95,"b":4,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Hugues Panassie?"},{"p":95,"b":5,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Yeah. Right. We just listened to that tape, and it was Tommy Ladner on trumpet."},{"p":95,"b":6,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah, Tommy Ladner. Wow. That brings back."},{"p":95,"b":7,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"And Mezz Mezzrow, Milton Mezzrow."},{"p":95,"b":8,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Milton Mezzrow."},{"p":95,"b":9,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Yourself on guitar."},{"p":95,"b":10,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Myself."},{"p":95,"b":11,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Pops Foster."},{"p":95,"b":12,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Pops Foster."},{"p":95,"b":13,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"And Manzie Johnson."},{"p":95,"b":14,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Manzie Johnson."},{"p":95,"b":15,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"On drums."},{"p":95,"b":16,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"On drums."},{"p":95,"b":17,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"I was thinking maybe, just to kick it off, maybe we could talk about some of those people, see if you remember anything. Do you remember Tommy Ladner?"},{"p":95,"b":18,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah, I remember Tommy Ladner. I don't know too much what I can say about him. He was a wonderful"},{"p":96,"b":0,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"man."},{"p":96,"b":1,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"You met him in New York?"},{"p":96,"b":2,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"And a musician. Yeah."},{"p":96,"b":3,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Uh-huh. He was from New Orleans,"},{"p":96,"b":4,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"right?"},{"p":96,"b":5,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":96,"b":6,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Did you play with him often, or --"},{"p":96,"b":7,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"No, just every time a record date come up and I was on it."},{"p":96,"b":8,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"I see."},{"p":96,"b":9,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":96,"b":10,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Right."},{"p":96,"b":11,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"And I did it."},{"p":96,"b":12,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Uh-huh."},{"p":96,"b":13,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"But that was some more money for me --"},{"p":96,"b":14,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Yeah."},{"p":96,"b":15,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Every time I done it."}]}